    },
    "message": "Count every refusal of the kernels, where it was raised and who fell back\n\nUnsupported is now a type of its own, so building one notes the caller's line (core/census.rs)\nat every site without editing them. or_rule! and the __wrapped__ call-backs count too, so the\ndriver's path shows as well as kernel_first's. Off until benchmarks/rule_shadow/refusal_census.py\nturns it on through SHELTERSIM_REFUSAL_CENSUS; a refusal without it pays one flag load.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
